      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=BOOK DETAILS\n\nTitle:\n{{ $('Fields').first().json.title }}\n\nAuthor:\n{{ $('Fields').first().json.author }}\n\nGenre:\n{{ $('Fields').first().json.genre }}\n\nRelease Date:\n{{ $('Fields').first().json.release_date }}\n\nMERGED SEARCH DATA\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n\nTASK\n\nRELEASE TIMING ANALYSIS\n\n1. Identify the nearest major U.S. holiday.\n2. Assign a holiday score (0-20).\n\n3. Return EXACTLY 3 nearby holidays.\n\nFor each holiday provide:\n- holiday_name\n- priority\n- reason (max 20 words)\n\n4. Analyze release competition.\n\n5. Return EXACTLY 4 competing books.\n\nFor each competitor provide:\n- title\n- reason (max 15 words)\n\n6. Assign competition score (0-20).\n7. Determine competition level.\n\n8. Analyze sports events occurring within 14 days of release.\n\n9. Return EXACTLY 4 sports events.\n\nFor each sports event provide:\n- event_name\n- priority\n- impact (max 20 words)\n\n10. Assign sports score (0-20).\n\n11. Calculate:\n- overall_release_timing_score (0-100)\n- opportunity_level\n- risk_level\n\nSALES FORECAST ANALYSIS\n\n12. Evaluate author popularity.\n\nReturn:\n- author_popularity_score (0-20)\n- popularity_level\n\n13. Estimate market demand.\n\nReturn:\n- market_demand_score (0-20)\n- sell_through_potential\n\n14. Return EXACTLY 3 comparable titles.\n\nFor each title provide:\n- title\n- reason (max 15 words)\n\n15. Estimate:\n- sales_potential\n- forecast_confidence\n\n16. Estimate first-year sales:\n- low\n- expected\n- high\n\n17. Provide:\n- final_recommendation (max 50 words)\n- executive_summary (max 40 words)\n- forecast_analysis (max 80 words)\n\nIMPORTANT\n\nUse concise outputs.\nDo not repeat information.\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\nNo markdown.\nNo explanations.",
